Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.89,0:00:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)大家 上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.11,0:00:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌巴利安…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)抽卡！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.83,0:00:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)那道光是什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)这个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.54,0:00:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从未感受过的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}强大力量 到底是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 发生了什么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.51,0:00:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修){\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}… 我应该说过。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会让你见识混沌的深渊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是 七皇真正的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.56,0:00:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶魔法 七皇之剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.35,0:00:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 将超百 No.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.89,0:00:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶为 CNo.！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.64,0:00:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶为 CNo.？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.11,0:01:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可你的 No.应该已经在墓地里了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.11,0:01:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.11,0:01:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 超百 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.35,0:01:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择1只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其怪兽效果无效并特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.97,0:01:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.97,0:01:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将 No.101
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寂静荣誉方舟骑士特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.43,0:01:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用阶级4的方舟骑士进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.89,0:01:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.09,0:01:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.57,0:01:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(众人)混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)现身吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.107！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.32,0:01:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.96,0:01:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)现身吧 CNo.106。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}熔岩掌 巨手红！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.83,0:02:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)来吧！CNo.105。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.97,0:02:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧拳击手 彗星之拳套！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(梅拉古)现身吧。CNo.103。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神葬零娘 拉格纳无限。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.47,0:02:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)放马过来吧！CNo.102。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.22,0:02:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无光闪电·高贵·恶魔！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.05,0:02:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，CNo.101。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法被满足的 灵魂守护者啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.28,0:02:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化为暗黑骑士 粉碎光芒吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)沉默荣誉·暗黑骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.61,0:03:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样。这才是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.94,0:03:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人类无法到达的 混沌深渊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.63,0:03:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？ 这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光是看着就让人起鸡皮疙瘩。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.56,0:03:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 凌牙的 CNo.！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。接下来才是 真正的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德罗瓦)这就是 你们的……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:05:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)超百 CNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.26,0:05:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(戈什)气势不错嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.69,0:05:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(六十郎)但是 我们也一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.67,0:05:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(暗川)怎么可能就这样 窝囊地……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(安娜)怎么能输可不能输啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.31,0:05:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(罗宾)来吧，放马过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.99,0:05:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)这就是纳修的力量……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(千尊)没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然强到这种地步……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.01,0:05:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且受其影响连其他七皇也……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.61,0:05:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，人类那群家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.22,0:05:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算联手也根本不可能赢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，纳修你真的能和曾经的同伴{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.47,0:05:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你又来这里了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别再用那个名字叫我了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.35,0:06:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊，现在的你是纳修。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被战火焚烧怀抱着愤怒与悲伤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}漂流到巴利安世界的背负着灵魂之人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让他变成这样的，是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.87,0:06:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.57,0:06:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是 只能用憎恨去回应憎恨的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由我招来的命运！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.94,0:06:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 纳修 你为了保护这个世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能和游马他们战斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.03,0:06:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗。我要战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.20,0:06:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是 纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪怕是曾经的同伴{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.48,0:06:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也全部 埋葬掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.49,0:06:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了巴利安世界！))
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 沉默荣誉暗黑骑士的\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.42,0:06:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑骑士 一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:06:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将对方１只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.67,0:07:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成自己的混沌超量单位！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.44,0:07:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 这次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.21,0:07:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连超量单位都不用吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.79,0:07:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)我把 诡计·人偶 希拉尔杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为 暗·骑士的 混沌·超量·单位。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.27,0:07:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗·灵魂·劫掠者！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.33,0:07:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 你的胡言乱语到此为止了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.83,0:07:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用暗·骑士 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见了 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.42,0:07:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊 真没劲……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.09,0:07:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过 一定要把你带回来我已经决定了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.45,0:07:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你把它当成命运已经接受了的那些东西{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用决斗 全部打碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 怎么做到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在挨到暗·骑士攻击的瞬间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.49,0:08:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送进墓地的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}诡计·人偶 暗影吞噬者的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.33,0:08:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.03,0:08:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗影吞噬者在墓地时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.85,0:08:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到直接攻击的玩家{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将这只怪兽以攻击表示特殊召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并与攻击过来的对方怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.67,0:08:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且这家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.14,0:08:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这次战斗中的破坏可以无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.77,0:08:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。吃了直接攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本来要完蛋的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拿影灵衣当盾牌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.07,0:08:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把生命值保住了是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵……挺有一套的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.73,0:08:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 打倒你才更有价值啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.42,0:08:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过真是让我吃惊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.16,0:08:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}远东的 作弊冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然能做到这种程度。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.55,0:08:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 这点程度就做给你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管怎么说，这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.97,0:08:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是能让我们和你之间的羁绊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.60,0:08:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重新苏醒的决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.77,0:08:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}羁绊吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无聊透顶。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.42,0:08:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.83,0:08:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟你们玩这种友情过家家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:08:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已经受够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:09:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙，你是认真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然是认真的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.22,0:09:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我对你，从来就没有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.40,0:09:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感受到什么友情啊羁绊啊那种甜腻腻的东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错，这样就好。{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}，憎恨我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.06,0:09:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是作为曾经的朋友，而是作为该打倒的敌人！》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们之间既然你说我们之间没有羁绊也没有友情{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.07,0:09:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就要在这场决斗中把那东西创造出来给你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.31,0:09:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动装备魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.52,0:09:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠光卫星{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备到暗影恐惧者上！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.60,0:09:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了这张卡的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.50,0:09:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被当作两份超量素材来使用！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级8的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.81,0:09:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗影恐惧者进行叠光！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只份量的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.43,0:09:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠光网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.84,0:10:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.40！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 天堂弦乐手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.27,0:10:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后叠光卫星
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.94,0:10:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将成为天堂弦乐手的叠光单位。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，使用这个效果
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.10,0:10:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.19,0:10:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这回合不能攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.77,0:10:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不容易有3000的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.67,0:10:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能攻击的话就没意义了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.12,0:10:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光声音大可打动不了我的心{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.72,0:10:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就跟你的话一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.48,0:10:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此那就让我来打动你吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动天堂弦乐的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽 一回合一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.64,0:10:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.08,0:10:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在对方怪兽身上放置一个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.47,0:10:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}弦计数器！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 天堂弦乐会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.52,0:10:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将放置了弦计数器的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.24,0:10:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在下一个回合结束的同时破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.51,0:10:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 还将原本攻击力数值的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.84,0:10:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赐予你！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为超量怪兽被送去墓地的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.58,0:10:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}影之幻影 被除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.96,0:10:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这一瞬间 我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:11:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动速攻魔法 幻影反应者！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.99,0:11:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的卡被除外时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地的一张卡返回手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要返回手牌的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.76,0:11:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 银辉混沌之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.59,0:11:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费了那么大功夫 把冒牌货的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌之力返回手牌了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 是大哥托付给我的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.44,0:11:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我相信 卡牌中蕴含的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.93,0:11:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人的思念这东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也应该有的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.37,0:11:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过决斗不断积累起来的那份思念啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.14,0:11:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真不像你会说的话啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！ 但是游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.65,0:11:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有凌牙 是你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.99,0:11:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说出这种话的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.33,0:11:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我给改变了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我也要用决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.60,0:11:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把已经改变了的你再一次 改变过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.36,0:11:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶人混沌之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.30,0:11:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 可以将自己的超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.27,0:12:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤出混沌超量怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 阶级８的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天堂之弦进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.95,0:12:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用１只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.28,0:12:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.82,0:12:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.40！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.56,0:12:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以人类睿智的结晶恶魔啊 苏醒吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.86,0:12:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 恶魔之弦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.33,0:12:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是那家伙新的 CNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恶魔之弦的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.24,0:12:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将放置有弦指示物的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.22,0:12:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.63,0:12:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})旋律之刺客！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.15,0:12:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，将被破坏的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.02,0:12:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原本攻击力数值的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.71,0:12:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，接下我的思念清醒过来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.90,0:13:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……这就是你的思念……》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恶魔之弦的进一步效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当破坏对方怪兽时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 这就是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.26,0:13:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你朝我投来的思念的强度吗》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.77,0:13:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.79,0:13:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《既然样子变回来了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.82,0:13:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再过一会儿心也应该能夺回来！》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.64,0:13:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑暗骑士的效果发动…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.48,0:13:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}持有混沌超量单位的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.33,0:13:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑暗骑士被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被特殊召唤到自己的场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.07,0:13:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}归来吧，从轮回中！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.57,0:14:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.09,0:14:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会回复黑暗骑士攻击力数值的量。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.27,0:14:16.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})唔…又死缠烂打地复活过来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.81,0:14:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 黑暗骑士已经没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量单位了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用恶魔锁链
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击黑暗骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！超量连接！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有超量单位的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.94,0:14:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上有这张卡时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.93,0:14:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这张卡变成超量单位！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.90,0:14:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的混沌超量单位……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……我的声音还是传不到吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:14:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动恶魔弦的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.76,0:15:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑骑士无论多少次都会复活！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动暗黑骑士的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.03,0:15:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}归来的林波！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.83,0:15:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)然后 恢复复活的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.69,0:15:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑骑士攻击力数值的生命！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.52,0:15:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命 5300。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要我还是巴利安的守护者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.64,0:15:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无数未得满足的灵魂都会借给我力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.79,0:15:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 差不多该放弃了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论你来多少次 我的心中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都不会收到你的心意。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.49,0:15:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 我绝不放弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算生命值回复得再多{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.50,0:15:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你现在的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.16,0:15:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也毫无疑问是我认识的神代凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.88,0:15:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.30,0:15:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用暗黑骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.73,0:16:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸收恶魔锁链！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.41,0:16:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那渺茫的希望到此为止了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.77,0:16:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就毫无防备了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.88,0:16:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次直接攻击就送你下地狱。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！恐慌洗牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.40,0:16:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})自己的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为对方效果对象时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.02,0:16:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上的所有怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.85,0:16:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为守备表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.95,0:16:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})并且，双方玩家{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.60,0:16:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地中的所有魔法·陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}返回卡组并洗牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.45,0:16:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然撑过去了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.45,0:16:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖伏一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.59,0:16:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《纳修：果然，你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.90,0:16:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个令人火大的混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.11,0:16:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢往舍弃了人类的我的心里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.23,0:16:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}塞进这么炽热的感情，还硬灌进来。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是啊，我想要的才不是什么炽热的感情。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.23,0:17:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而是能把一切焚烧殆尽的憎恨！》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.63,0:17:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在，就让你见识一下有趣的东西吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.08,0:17:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完。我还不能……在这里倒下。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，等着我。我一定会{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.26,0:17:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我们和璃绪小姐之间的羁绊重新夺回来给你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管挨你多少拳{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.76,0:17:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要是为了游马，我不管多少次我都会站起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.03,0:17:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪怕这副身躯毁灭我心中的刀刃也绝不会折断！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.95,0:17:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得好 暗川！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.76,0:17:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里就算同归于尽也要守住！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.21,0:17:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正义是… 正义是绝对不会输的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.15,0:17:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且爱必定会胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马我绝对会保护好！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.96,0:18:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 放马过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.60,0:18:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这… 这里是。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(咔嚓)太好了 你醒过来了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都没事… 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.93,0:18:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)是的 没问题。大家 都没事哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.00,0:18:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.11,0:18:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差不多重要的同伴也该是不是在担心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事情变成什么样了我这么想着。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.25,0:18:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)这家伙是我送你的粉丝福利！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.39,0:19:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 抱歉啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 本来打算更加献身的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到 正义的英雄竟然会输…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.64,0:19:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在巨人汉德雷特面前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.23,0:19:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.45,0:19:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我来捏碎吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.06,0:19:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 不甘心…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.57,0:19:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 弟子的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.23,0:19:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我无法守护下去了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原谅我这个没用的师父吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好烫！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烫得烦死了啊 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.77,0:19:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然那么喜欢烫的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就连一个细胞都用我的拳头给你烧个精光！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.67,0:19:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真够狠的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.48,0:20:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欠巴利安的还没还上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.09,0:20:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连欠你的也还不上了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.83,0:20:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}女人。你打得不错。安心睡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连拖延时间都做不到真是丢人。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.38,0:20:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.34,0:20:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实传达到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 对现在的我来说那只会让我觉得烦而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.44,0:20:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.36,0:20:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 明明是为了游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}非赢不可的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.97,0:20:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 本该带着璃绪{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.22,0:20:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回到游马那里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.49,0:20:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.18,0:20:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.33,0:20:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)怎么样 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.15,0:21:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的同伴一个接一个被打倒的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被压倒性的力量 毫无还手之力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.10,0:21:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被碾碎的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？ 接下来是你的回合了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是说 刚才那下让你心态崩了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.15,0:21:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然堕落到这种地步。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.85,0:21:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么找回本心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.80,0:21:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从一开始就没有 已经彻底{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.49,0:21:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}沦落成外道了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错 这样就对了。 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.03,0:21:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样憎恨身为巴利安的我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.80,0:21:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以同伴的死为食粮让对我的憎恶燃烧起来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.27,0:21:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过打倒这样的你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我作为神代凌牙活过来的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.04,0:21:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能全部埋葬掉》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.61,0:21:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙… 不你这家伙 已经不是凌牙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得没错。我是纳修。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.21,0:21:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是巴利安的纳修啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.17,0:21:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我马上让你在地狱里和同伴们见面！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.11,0:23:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.07,0:23:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.17,0:23:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.87,0:23:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.93,0:23:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.39,0:24:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.87,0:24:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.24,0:24:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.17,0:24:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
